# Domain events

Record a domain event on the aggregate when another part of the same domain must react to a change. Dispatch using the unit of work configured by the service. Establish whether handlers run inside the transaction or after commit before relying on their effects. For cross-service delivery, use an integration event and the transactional outbox.
